update nlohmann_json to 3.11.3

Backported from https://github.com/intel/dptf/pull/47/commits/3bfc10c2208b0dceec8005257839a623c142cf13

Fixes b/343958733

From the 3.11.3 release notes:

Fix char_traits deprecation warning "char_traits is deprecated: char_traits for T not equal to char, wchar_t, char8_t, char16_t or char32_t is non-standard".

